  "historyNote": "#12805, eff 12-15-19; ss by #14349, INTERIM, eff 8-26-25; ss by #14471, eff 1-2-26, EXPIRES: 1-2-36",
  "inScheme": "https://granitestate.github.io/rules/scheme",
